{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1496731-accusations-against-outstar-and-paradox-by-former-latin-america-community-ambassador","id":1496731,"title":"Accusations against Outstar and Paradox by former Latin America Community Ambassador","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Additional Discussion","Off-Topic"],"posts":[{"date":"2022-11-10T13:17:38-08:00","id":1496731,"title":"Accusations against Outstar and Paradox by former Latin America Community Ambassador","content":"So, something I missed (it came out Monday, so between the US elections and Musk/Twitter it seems like this didn't hit as many people's feeds as it should have), but saw elsewhere and felt it should get discussed here too:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://twitter.com/a_AlessaTorres/status/1589837938950819840?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw%7Ctwcamp%5Etweetembed%7Ctwterm%5E1589837938950819840%7Ctwgr%5Ea056e9eca8791c4937b3ea635adf092018c1d87e%7Ctwcon%5Es1_&amp;ref_url=https%3A%2F%2Fforum.rpg.net%2Findex.php%3Fthreads%2Fwod-allegations-against-outstar-and-paradox-interactive-for-racist-and-exclusionary-behavior-to-latin-american-wod-fans.904222%2F\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://twitter.com/a_AlessaTorres/status/1589837938950819840?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw%7Ctwcamp%5Etweetembed%7Ctwterm%5E1589837938950819840%7Ctwgr%5Ea056e9eca8791c4937b3ea635adf092018c1d87e%7Ctwcon%5Es1_&amp;ref_url=https%3A%2F%2Fforum.rpg.net%2Findex.php%3Fthreads%2Fwod-allegations-against-outstar-and-paradox-interactive-for-racist-and-exclusionary-behavior-to-latin-american-wod-fans.904222%2F\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://twitter.com/a_AlessaTorres/status/1589837938950819840?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw%7Ctwcamp%5Etweetembed%7Ctwterm%5E1589837938950819840%7Ctwgr%5Ea056e9eca8791c4937b3ea635adf092018c1d87e%7Ctwcon%5Es1_&amp;ref_url=https%3A%2F%2Fforum.rpg.net%2Findex.php%3Fthreads%2Fwod-allegations-against-outstar-and-paradox-interactive-for-racist-and-exclusionary-behavior-to-latin-american-wod-fans.904222%2F\" target=\"_blank\"> https://twitter.com/a_AlessaTorres/status/1589837938950819840?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw%7Ctwcamp%5Etweetembed%7Ctwterm%5E1589837938950819840%7Ctwgr%5Ea056e9eca8791c4937b3ea635adf092018c1d87e%7Ctwcon%5Es1_&amp;ref_url=https%3A%2F%2Fforum.rpg.net%2Findex.php%3Fthreads%2Fwod-allegations-against-outstar-and-paradox-interactive-for-racist-and-exclusionary-behavior-to-latin-american-wod-fans.904222%2F </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> I wish I could say I was surprised, but most of my WoD friends from Brazil have expressed similar issues for a long time. It is, however, very depressing to hear that Outstar and Paradox are so hostile towards marketing to the very large and active Latin American WoD fan-base, and have done so much to try to silo things so the rest of us wouldn't know what was going on.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-10T13:38:12-08:00","id":1496734,"title":"","content":"So. i'm brazilian (born and raised in rio) and outstar has always been perfectly kind to me. And one of the writers from Hunter is indeed brazilian. i'm sure that the problem of marketing to my country is because of a problem with brazil. You see,our government for whatever reason wants rpg and video games to be extrememly expensive, Paradox just can't make a profit with our laws. I can't see xenophobia is part of the equation","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-10T13:41:58-08:00","id":1496736,"title":"","content":"I also wish I could say I was surprised, but it's all very sadly par for the course with Paradox.<br /> <br /> What blows my mind is them saying the Latin American market isn't profitable, because lol, what? In what universe? There's no excuse that actually works for racist practices, but as an attempt to paper it up goes, that one is just....really not well thought out.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-10T13:43:45-08:00","id":1496737,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ArcaneArts</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1496731-accusations-against-outstar-and-paradox-by-former-latin-america-community-ambassador?p=1496736#post1496736\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I also wish I could say I was surprised, but it's all very sadly par for the course with Paradox.<br /> <br /> What blows my mind is them saying the Latin American market isn't profitable, because lol, what? In what universe? There's no excuse that actually works for racist practices, but as an attempt to paper it up goes, that one is just....really not well thought out.</div> </div> </div> </div>i can't speak for other countries,but in mine. Anything that is related to gamse is forced by law to be three maybe four times as expensive as it should,it is extremely hard for any compamny to make a profit.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-10T13:45:47-08:00","id":1496738,"title":"","content":"Did you... read her whole thread there? Catch how much of an insider perspective she has? Alessa has research data on the marketing side of things, and there's no real dispute over the fact that non-English speakers were pushed out of the main WoD Discord server to go to their own server despite the main server having mods that speak Spanish and Brazilian Portuguese to handle any issues in that regard.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-10T13:52:02-08:00","id":1496740,"title":"","content":"My friend created a Mage version of herself, even though she didn't intend on playing, because she loved the idea of Correspondence 3. She imagined the facility of being able to visit family back home, in Latin America, and continue pursuing opportunities in Canada without air travel. At least for her, there was an appeal and I think that is just one avenue for marketing the company could pursue.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thank you for passing time with me in conversation. <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1480242-horizon-s-wild-and-crazy-homebrew-rules-and-metaplot-choices\" target=\"_blank\">My Hacks</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26467-horizonparty2021","name":"HorizonParty2021","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26467_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"610"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-10T13:54:03-08:00","id":1496741,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nicolas Milioni</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1496731-accusations-against-outstar-and-paradox-by-former-latin-america-community-ambassador?p=1496734#post1496734\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So. i'm brazilian (born and raised in rio) and outstar has always been perfectly kind to me. And one of the writers from Hunter is indeed brazilian. i'm sure that the problem of marketing to my country is because of a problem with brazil. You see,our government for whatever reason wants rpg and video games to be extrememly expensive, Paradox just can't make a profit with our laws. I can't see xenophobia is part of the equation</div> </div> </div> </div>So, here's the thing about that: lots of game companies and publishers (across the board of video games, board and card games, and ttrpgs) have consistently reported that, while government impositions <i>are</i> expensive, the Brazilian market itself is made up of what is mostly <i>overwhelmingly enthusiastic buyers</i>, and for those who can overcome the cost hurdles, it tends to pay out in the long run because of that enthusiasm. Small companies might not be able to make the hurdle, but Paradox is not that company.<br /> <br /> On top of that, even if that were true, the rest of it is not justifiable. There's no reason to alienate the audience with their content, there's no reason to have their apologies in private with a global audience craving for accountable creators, there's no reason to segregate their community beyond the merest practical reason of language (which a lot of other comapnies don't bother with-I'm frequently on servers with mixed language speakers).<br /> <br /> Paradox, through the entire run of their acquisition of World of Darkness, has demonstrated.....quite simply, not the best head for race relations. Even if it's not blatant racism and xenophobia, it's negligent and indifferent in a way that a company with global presence really can't afford to be.<br /> <br /> Even with the best intentions, it's a bad look, and the details of this alongisde past issues on this subject is increasingly making it hard to assume the best intentions.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":99,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","user":"ArcaneArts","date":". 11-10-2022, 04:56 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-10T13:55:06-08:00","id":1496742,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Heavy Arms</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1496731-accusations-against-outstar-and-paradox-by-former-latin-america-community-ambassador?p=1496738#post1496738\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Did you... read her whole thread there? Catch how much of an insider perspective she has? Alessa has research data on the marketing side of things, and there's no real dispute over the fact that non-English speakers were pushed out of the main WoD Discord server to go to their own server despite the main server having mods that speak Spanish and Brazilian Portuguese to handle any issues in that regard.</div> </div> </div> </div>i read it, lemme quote my opinions as to each tweet<br /> <br /> #1 Everyone there knows i'm from rio,i didn't notice anyone treating me differently<br /> #2 don't recall anyone being banned for speaking in a diffewrent language<br /> #3The second inquisition book had terms some think are racist or xenophobic,it was a research failure, they did apologize. it's true they didn't point in tghe main website,i honestly feels it was a good idea,it's better to not draw attention to the problem<br /> #4 i don't know what to say about alessa saying they were making a profit. I'm not accusying her of lying,but i also can't see how it's true. The laws making everything so expensive you see.<br /> #5 like,i've been in the discord for sucha long time,i never saw any xenophobia,i never saw any gatekeeping.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-10T13:57:27-08:00","id":1496743,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ArcaneArts</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1496731-accusations-against-outstar-and-paradox-by-former-latin-america-community-ambassador?p=1496741#post1496741\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So, here's the thing about that: lots of game companies and publishers (across the board of video games, board and card games, and ttrpgs) have consistently reported that, while government impositions <i>are</i> expensive, the Brazilian market itself is made up of what is mostly <i>overwhelmingly enthusiastic buyers</i>, and for those who can overcome the cost hurdles, it tends to pay out in the long run because of that enthusiasm. Small companies might not be able to make the hurdle, but Paradox is not that company.<br /> <br /> On top of that, even if that were true, the rest of it is not justifiable. There's no reason to alienate the audience with their content, there's no reason to have their apologies in private with a global audience craving for accountable creators, there's no reason to segregate their community beyond the merest practical reason of language (which a lot of other comapnies don't bother with-I'm frequently on servers with mixed language speakers).<br /> <br /> Paradox, through the entire run of their acquisition of World of Darkness, has demonstrated.....quite simply, not the best head for race relations. Even if it's not blatant racism and xenophobia, it's negligent and indifferent in a way that a company with global presence really can't afford to be.<br /> <br /> Even with the best intentions, it's a bad look, and the details of this alongisde past issues on this subject is increasingly making it hard to assume the best intentions.</div> </div> </div> </div>well i suppose there's no reason to disbelive alessa,i'm just saying i cannot with absolute certainty she's right because i haven't seen any of it go down.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-10T14:04:37-08:00","id":1496745,"title":"","content":"How are you... not accusing her of lying?<br /> <br /> 3/5 of your responses are: I didn't see it, so it didn't happen, thus Alessa is lying.<br /> <br /> One is not actually accusing her of lying, but if I have no idea why you're defending Paradox here. &quot;It's a good idea to hide this, even though one Tweet from one person can expose it, and it will get even more negative attention because we tried to hide it than if we just owned up to it in the beginning,&quot; is nonsensical. In the US we have a very simple phrase for this: &quot;The cover up is worse than the crime.&quot; A lot of people would get in a lot less trouble (socially and legally) if they didn't try to hide their misdeeds only to get caught anyway.<br /> <br /> Another is, you saying you don't have any facts, and even though Alessa does she must be wrong. You can all that not accusing her of lying all you want but... calling her a liar is probably more charitable interpretation of your post than the alternative of you thinking that professionals in the industry know less than you and thus can't be right because you say so.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-10T14:05:13-08:00","id":1496746,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nicolas Milioni</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1496731-accusations-against-outstar-and-paradox-by-former-latin-america-community-ambassador?p=1496742#post1496742\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">i read it, lemme quote my opinions as to each tweet<br /> <br /> #1 Everyone there knows i'm from rio,i didn't notice anyone treating me differently<br /> #2 don't recall anyone being banned for speaking in a diffewrent language<br /> #3The second inquisition book had terms some think are racist or xenophobic,it was a research failure, they did apologize. it's true they didn't point in tghe main website,i honestly feels it was a good idea,it's better to not draw attention to the problem<br /> #4 i don't know what to say about alessa saying they were making a profit. I'm not accusying her of lying,but i also can't see how it's true. The laws making everything so expensive you see.<br /> #5 like,i've been in the discord for sucha long time,i never saw any xenophobia,i never saw any gatekeeping.</div> </div> </div> </div>Buddy, my dude, I'm seeing a problem where you're saying &quot;I didn't see it, therefore it's unlikely to have been like that&quot;, which quite frankly only helpful if you have a good top-down perspective to see with, which.....as far as I know, you're an individual observer with casual participation in the hobby.<br /> <br /> Part of the reason why Alessa's statement is alarming is that she <i>is</i> in a position to see more of the big picture impact of what's happening in response-she sees more of the reaction from more people, both in larger communities and with more individual accounys as people come to her as the communtiy manager, she gets accountability (or what passes for it) from Paradox, and she's able to question people more directly at Paradox about any trends and patterns she sees.<br /> <br /> A person on top of the tower is more readily able to see how the streets spell &quot;Turd&quot; than someone who is walking in them, particularly since people who are in the streets are more prone to paying attention to what's going on with them and where they're going rather than some of the unusual formation of the city infrastructure. Same principle.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-10T14:06:41-08:00","id":1496747,"title":"","content":"Fair point,kelly.<br /> i'll just wait and hope justice is done","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-10T15:20:00-08:00","id":1496751,"title":"","content":"Messing with my location and language settings in YouTube, &quot;Mundo das Trevas, jogo real&quot; doesn't turn up what I'm looking for. That is, I want to see how much live-play content there is. Supposedly, WoD is huge in Latin America. Will try in Spanish.<br /> <br /> Edit: Still no. It's just YouTube restricting me.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thank you for passing time with me in conversation. <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1480242-horizon-s-wild-and-crazy-homebrew-rules-and-metaplot-choices\" target=\"_blank\">My Hacks</a>.","edited":{"userid":26467,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26467-horizonparty2021","user":"HorizonParty2021","date":". 11-10-2022, 06:25 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26467-horizonparty2021","name":"HorizonParty2021","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26467_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"610"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-10T19:27:41-08:00","id":1496773,"title":"","content":"With regard to Alessa's truthfulness, I listened to the audio, which was easier for me as someone without a Twitter account (because who needs the trouble that comes with it). I believe she was telling the truth from her perspective. There is a question of nepotism concerning her replacement. I think it all comes down to exactly how effective the bot is and how easy it is for the mods to use. <br /> <br /> One thing I wonder is how I would feel as a user if someone was speaking about me or in response to something I said in another language and I was unaware of how to use any translation tool, bot or other.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thank you for passing time with me in conversation. <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1480242-horizon-s-wild-and-crazy-homebrew-rules-and-metaplot-choices\" target=\"_blank\">My Hacks</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26467-horizonparty2021","name":"HorizonParty2021","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26467_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"610"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}